om&gt;\nIn-Reply-To: &lt;CAGsfBeCt-+EcvQnQS1vrEazZUsv1WpJ2Qhs++NgjHhQ0=8Byng@mail.gmail.com&gt;\nFrom: Yashwanth &lt;yashwanthrajdj33@gmail.com&gt;\nDate: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 14:01:10 +0530\nX-Gm-Features: AcwNN1W5LElmpBGTg1Ixgv_8mvBs3kDdkS3utFiJIh1LDzw0kR47D-3r0Ky8ApU\nMessage-ID: &lt;CAGsfBeAvJu++rMe6kL5Wb2_7Vo8Tv_d887+X65TPpW_3Fp2eMA@mail.gmail.com&gt;\nSubject: Fwd: Leave Request for internals , as well as work from home on Saturday (Tommorow)\nTo: punitbagali007@gmail.com\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary=&quot;000000000000947bce0659c6cf7d&quot;\n\n--000000000000947bce0659c6cf7d\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Yashwanth &lt;yashwanthrajdj33@gmail.com&gt;\nDate: Fri, Dec 19, 2025 at 6:54=E2=80=AFPM\nSubject: Leave Request for internals , as well as work from home on\nSaturday (Tommorow)\nTo: &lt;hretherxinnovations@gmail.com&gt;\n\n\nDear Sir/Madam,\nI hope this message finds you well.\nI would like to inform you that I have my internal examinations scheduled\nfrom Monday to Wednesday. Hence, I kindly request leave for the mentioned\ndays.\n\nAdditionally, I would like to request Work From Home for tomorrow\n(Saturday) so that I can effectively focus on my assigned work at EtherX\nInnovations Pvt Ltd while also preparing for my examinations from home.\n\nI assure you that I will stay available online and ensure all\nresponsibilities are managed without any disruption.\n\nThank you for your understanding and support.\n\nSincerely,\nYashwanth Raj\nEtherX Innovations Pvt Ltd\n\n--000000000000947bce0659c6cf7d\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\n&lt;div dir=3D&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=3D&quot;gmail_quote gmail_quote_container&quot;&gt;&lt;=\ndiv dir=3D&quot;ltr&quot; class=3D&quot;gmail_attr&quot;&gt;---------- Forwarded message ---------=\n&lt;br&gt;From